  "html": "<div class=\"x-section e1143-e1 mvr-0 mvr-1\"><div class=\"x-bg\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"x-bg-layer-lower-image\" style=\" background-image: url(https://cosmeticimplantdentistrywp.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/int-hero.jpg); background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: 50% 80%; background-size: cover;\"></div></div><div class=\"x-row x-container max width e1143-e2 mvr-7 mvr-8 mvr-9 mvr-a mvr-e mvr-f\"><div class=\"x-row-inner\"><div class=\"x-col e1143-e3 mvr-k mvr-l mvr-m mvr-n\"><div class=\"x-text x-text-headline e1143-e4 mvr-q mvr-r mvr-s\"><div class=\"x-text-content\"><div class=\"x-text-content-text\"><h1 class=\"x-text-content-text-primary\">Clear Braces</h1></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"x-section e1143-e5 mvr-0 mvr-2 mvr-3\"><div class=\"x-row x-container max width e1143-e6 mvr-7 mvr-8 mvr-a mvr-b mvr-e mvr-g\"><div class=\"x-row-inner\"><div class=\"x-col e1143-e7 mvr-k mvr-o mvr-p\"><div class=\"x-text x-text-headline e1143-e8 mvr-r mvr-t mvr-u\"><div class=\"x-text-content\"><div class=\"x-text-content-text\"><h2 class=\"x-text-content-text-primary\">Receive Clear Braces in Kansas City, MO</h2></div></div></div><div class=\"x-text x-content e1143-e9 mvr-v mvr-w\">Many patients have crooked or misaligned teeth that affect their mouth's function and confidence. Cosmetic and Implant Dentistry Westport proudly offers clear braces in Kansas City, MO because it is among the most convenient and transparent solutions for teeth. Our team comprises trained, certified, and highly experienced dentists with extensive knowledge of aligners. Our treatments include clear braces, a thin type of brace made from materials that blend in with natural teeth. We apply our clear and invisible braces to reduce and prevent overcrowding, underbites, and overbites. Our dentists will gladly assess your teeth's condition, discuss your goals, and customize a solution to enhance your smile. </div><a class=\"x-anchor x-anchor-button e1143-e10 mvr-x\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"/contact-us/\"><div class=\"x-anchor-content\"><div class=\"x-anchor-text\"><span class=\"x-anchor-text-primary\">Contact Us</span></div></div></a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"x-section e1143-e11 mvr-0 mvr-2 mvr-3 mvr-4 mvr-5\"><div class=\"x-row x-container max width e1143-e12 mvr-7 mvr-8 mvr-9 mvr-c mvr-h mvr-i\"><div class=\"x-row-inner\"><div class=\"x-col e1143-e13 mvr-k mvr-l mvr-p\"><span class=\"x-image e1143-e14 mvr-y mvr-z\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cosmeticimplantdentistrywp.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/CosmeticImplantWestport-1290528178.jpg\" srcset=\"https://cosmeticimplantdentistrywp.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/CosmeticImplantWestport-1290528178.jpg 600w, https://cosmeticimplantdentistrywp.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/CosmeticImplantWestport-1290528178-300x300.jpg 300w, https://cosmeticimplantdentistrywp.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/CosmeticImplantWestport-1290528178-150x150.jpg 150w, https://cosmeticimplantdentistrywp.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/CosmeticImplantWestport-1290528178-100x100.jpg 100w, https://cosmeticimplantdentistrywp.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/CosmeticImplantWestport-1290528178-50x50.jpg 50w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" alt=\"laughing young man\"></span></div><div class=\"x-col e1143-e15 mvr-k mvr-l mvr-m\"><div class=\"x-div e1143-e16 mvr-11\"><div class=\"x-text x-text-headline e1143-e17 mvr-r mvr-s mvr-t\"><div class=\"x-text-content\"><div class=\"x-text-content-text\"><h3 class=\"x-text-content-text-primary\">Are Clear Braces Right for Me?</h3></div></div></div><div class=\"x-text x-content e1143-e18 mvr-v\">Clear braces are the preferred teeth alignment solution for many of our patients because they are invisible. The biggest reason patients choose clear braces is because the braces are transparent. You can smile and reveal your teeth, and others won't notice that braces are on your teeth.</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"x-section e1143-e19 mvr-0 mvr-2 mvr-3 mvr-4\"><div class=\"x-row x-container max width e1143-e20 mvr-7 mvr-9 mvr-c mvr-d mvr-h mvr-j\"><div class=\"x-row-inner\"><div class=\"x-col e1143-e21 mvr-k mvr-l mvr-p\"><span class=\"x-image e1143-e22 mvr-y mvr-10\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cosmeticimplantdentistrywp.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/CosmeticImplantWestport-1326417862.jpg\" srcset=\"https://cosmeticimplantdentistrywp.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/CosmeticImplantWestport-1326417862.jpg 600w, https://cosmeticimplantdentistrywp.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/CosmeticImplantWestport-1326417862-300x300.jpg 300w, https://cosmeticimplantdentistrywp.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/CosmeticImplantWestport-1326417862-150x150.jpg 150w, https://cosmeticimplantdentistrywp.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/CosmeticImplantWestport-1326417862-100x100.jpg 100w, https://cosmeticimplantdentistrywp.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/CosmeticImplantWestport-1326417862-50x50.jpg 50w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" alt=\"smiling young woman\"></span></div><div class=\"x-col e1143-e23 mvr-k mvr-l mvr-m\"><div class=\"x-div e1143-e24 mvr-11 mvr-12\"><div class=\"x-text x-text-headline e1143-e25 mvr-r mvr-s mvr-t\"><div class=\"x-text-content\"><div class=\"x-text-content-text\"><h3 class=\"x-text-content-text-primary\">Choose Us for a Clear, Beautiful Smile</h3></div></div></div><div class=\"x-text x-content e1143-e26 mvr-v\">Most people require dental work, but they rarely want the work to show. Our clear braces offer the most precise solution for misaligned or crowded teeth. After they take effect, you'll see straighter and uniformed teeth within months. Our treatments are customized to the size and shape of our patients' mouths so they fit and function comfortably. Whether you want to close a gap and make your teeth closer or free up space in your mouth, we can provide an optimal solution. We look forward to developing a treatment that beautifies teeth and fits your lifestyle seamlessly.</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"x-section e1143-e27 mvr-0 mvr-3 mvr-6\"><div class=\"cs-content x-global-block x-global-block-1208 e1143-e28\"><div class=\"x-section e1208-e2 mxk-0\"><div class=\"x-bg\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"x-bg-layer-lower-image\" style=\" background-image: url(https://cosmeticimplantdentistrywp.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/IMG_0562-scaled.jpg); background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: center; background-size: cover;\"></div><div class=\"x-bg-layer-upper-color\" style=\" background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55);\"></div></div><div class=\"x-row x-container max width e1208-e3 mxk-1 mxk-2\"><div class=\"x-row-inner\"><div class=\"x-col e1208-e4 mxk-3\"><div class=\"x-text x-text-headline e1208-e5 mxk-4\"><div class=\"x-text-content\"><div class=\"x-text-content-text\"><h3 class=\"x-text-content-text-primary\">Choose Us for the Perfect Smile</h3></div></div></div><a class=\"x-anchor x-anchor-button e1208-e6 mxk-5\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"tel:816-388-0985\"><div class=\"x-anchor-content\"><div class=\"x-anchor-text\"><span class=\"x-anchor-text-primary\">Call Now</span></div></div></a></div></div></div></div></div><style> .mxk-0.x-section{margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;border-top-width:0;border-right-width:0;border-bottom-width:0;border-left-width:0;padding-top:150px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:150px;padding-left:0px;background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.82);z-index:1;}.mxk-1.x-row{z-index:auto;margin-right:auto;margin-left:auto;border-top-width:0;border-right-width:0;border-bottom-width:0;border-left-width:0;padding-top:1px;padding-right:1px;padding-bottom:1px;padding-left:1px;font-size:1em;}.mxk-1 > .x-row-inner{flex-direction:row;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:stretch;align-content:stretch;margin-top:calc(((20px / 2) + 1px) * -1);margin-right:calc(((20px / 2) + 1px) * -1);margin-bottom:calc(((20px / 2) + 1px) * -1);margin-left:calc(((20px / 2) + 1px) * 