  "text": "CLEAR BRACES\nRECEIVE CLEAR BRACES IN KANSAS CITY, MO\nMany patients have crooked or misaligned teeth that affect their mouth's function and confidence. Cosmetic and Implant Dentistry Westport proudly offers clear braces in Kansas City, MO because it is among the most convenient and transparent solutions for teeth. Our team comprises trained, certified, and highly experienced dentists with extensive knowledge of aligners. Our treatments include clear braces, a thin type of brace made from materials that blend in with natural teeth. We apply our clear and invisible braces to reduce and prevent overcrowding, underbites, and overbites. Our dentists will gladly assess your teeth's condition, discuss your goals, and customize a solution to enhance your smile.\nCONTACT US\nARE CLEAR BRACES RIGHT FOR ME?\nClear braces are the preferred teeth alignment solution for many of our patients because they are invisible. The biggest reason patients choose clear braces is because the braces are transparent. You can smile and reveal your teeth, and others won't notice that braces are on your teeth.\nCHOOSE US FOR A CLEAR, BEAUTIFUL SMILE\nMost people require dental work, but they rarely want the work to show. Our clear braces offer the most precise solution for misaligned or crowded teeth. After they take effect, you'll see straighter and uniformed teeth within months. Our treatments are customized to the size and shape of our patients' mouths so they fit and function comfortably. Whether you want to close a gap and make your teeth closer or free up space in your mouth, we can provide an optimal solution. We look forward to developing a treatment that beautifies teeth and fits your lifestyle seamlessly.\nCHOOSE US FOR THE PERFECT SMILE\nCALL NOW",
